  "openQuestions": [
    "O0 returns undefined (legacy files kcd/20250722, koicd/20240829, jaboReimbursement/20250108) before 2026-01-01 and '20260101' on/after. Each future reference release needs another hardcoded cutoff; the server should own a version table instead.",
    "new Date('2026-01-01') is UTC midnight, so in time zones west of UTC the cutoff moves to 2025-12-31 local. In KST it is correct. The server must use an explicit Asia/Seoul date.",
    "An unparseable 기준일시 (e.g. 8-digit 'yyyyMMdd') gives Invalid Date, and isBefore(Invalid, cutoff) is false, so it silently picks the 2026 version.",
    "Several screens call the static queries without 기준일시 (DiseaseSearchModal KOICD tree, ReservedDisease, DocumentDiseaseSearchModal, settings templates, PrescriptionInputSearchCrm), so they always use today's version even when editing an older record.",
    "qF falls back to the earliest 적용일자 when the visit is before every available date (instead of failing). Should the server reject such dates?",
    "qF returns the original list string, so a dashed entry such as '2025-04-01' is passed verbatim to /settings/references/reimbursement-codes?적용일자=; the server format of 적용일자목록 entries is not confirmed."
  ]
